  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nConsider A as '×'\n\nConsider B as '+'\n\nConsider C as '÷'\n\nSo,\n\n10 A 5 B 6 C 2 = 53 ⇒ 10 × 5 + 6 ÷ 2 = 53\n\n⇒ 10 × 5 + __6 ÷ 2__ = 53\n\n⇒ __10 × 5__ + 3 = 53\n\n⇒ __50 + 3__ = 53\n\n⇒ 53 = 53 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n6 A 4 B 8 C 2 = 28 ⇒ 6 × 4 + 8 ÷ 2 = 28\n\n⇒ 6 × 4 + __**8 ÷ 2**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __**6 × 4**__ + 4 = 28\n\n⇒ __24 + 4__ = 28\n\n⇒ 28 = 28 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n17 A 5 B 18 C 9 = ? ⇒ 17 × 5 + 18 ÷ 9 = ? \n\n⇒ 17 × 5 + __**18 ÷ 9**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**17 × 5**__ + 2 = ?\n\n⇒ __85** + 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 87 = ?\n\nHence, **\"Option 2\"** is the correct answer.",
